[TEXT] All evidence is in hand. The upstream cascade is ruled out (OSPF fabric healthy, 10.0.0.76 reachable with 0% loss from both dswa2 and dswb2), the relay binary is present on the broken devices, and the process comparison is definitive. Proceeding to Phase 5.

